WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.000
Choose the page from the sidebar
From the sidebar choose “Automations”.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:12.000
Open Automations
Go to Automations and start a new rule with a name that explains its purpose.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:19.000
Choose the trigger and conditions
Set when the rule runs, then add suitable conditions such as the channel, the tag or the conversation status.

00:00:19.000 --> 00:00:25.000
Set the actions
Add the action you need, such as sending a message or assigning a team. Review the order of the actions and the message contents.

00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:34.000
Test, then turn it on
Use “Test a message” to check the rule. When it's ready choose “Run the rule after saving”, then “Save and run”.
